This repository is an independent companion (compose wrappers, scripts, and
Chinese deployment notes) for the upstream project:

  https://github.com/milind-soni/OpenMausBot

OpenMausBot itself is Apache-2.0-licensed by its authors (with a separate
source-available `enterprise/` tree). This companion does not re-license
upstream code. When you install OpenMausBot via npm, download a desktop
release, or pull a GHCR image, you are using upstream artifacts under their
own licenses.
